"P1037755513" "We've got trouble. Arachnos just kidnapped one of our new comm officers, Agent Longbright. Not only is he a valuable source of info to Arachnos; he's a good man who can't be allowed to go down like this. I need you to break him out. You only have an hour before Arachnos will get him out of Siren's call; once he's in the Rogue Isles, our job becomes a whole lot harder. <br><br>Don't accept this task if you're not willing to face villains who are trying to kill you."
