"P1681730626" "Arachnos just took over a Longbow supply depot. That's bad, but what I'm about to tell you is worse: that supply depot was actually a storehouse for a lot of Longbow's sensitive information. If Arachnos is allowed to remain in control of the depot, they'll find that info eventually. So you have to kick them out. Within the hour. <br><br>Don't accept this task if you're not willing to face villains who are trying to kill you."
